---
layout: base.njk
title: Home
has_sidebar: true
---

<div class="layout">

  <main>

    <section class="hero">
      <div class="introduction">
        <h1>Hello!</h1>
        <p class="lede">My name is Valentina Montagna, I’m a Staff Product Designer with over fourteen years of experience in the digital space and a deep commitment for connecting product strategy with design execution.</p>
        <p class="intro-text">Born and raised in Italy, I took my career through the UK and Berlin before landing in Silicon Valley, where I worked as a Senior Growth Designer on consumer apps like <a href="https://bandcamp.com/" target="_blank">Bandcamp</a>, <a href="https://evernote.com/" target="_blank">Evernote</a>, <a href="https://www.everand.com/" target="_blank">Everand</a>, and <a href="https://www.masterclass.com/" target="_blank">MasterClass</a>. </p>
        <p class="intro-text">To a team, I bring craft prowess and a systemic mindset I stubbornly stick to. Working on digital products means I get to combine my art and graphic design background with a data-informed mindset. I take a lean approach to problem-solving, and love finding an artful way to put an idea to the test. I believe better interfaces result from better product decisions. That’s what turns design into a strategic force.</p>
        <p class="intro-text">In my spare time, I am a voracious reader and a maker, filling up sketchbooks with drawings and lettering, experimenting with printmaking, and playing with frontend development. Finally, designers who code are cool again ♥ </p>
        <p class="intro-text">I am currently freelancing.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

  </main>

  <aside class="sidebar">
    <div class="sidebar-icons">
      <button class="icon-button" aria-label="Toggle theme">
        <img src="/assets/icons/switch_light.svg" alt="" width="112" height="112">
      </button>
      <button class="icon-button" aria-label="Change color">
        <img src="/assets/icons/pencils_light.svg" alt="" width="112" height="112">
      </button>
      <button class="icon-button" aria-label="Save">
        <img src="/assets/icons/floppy_light.svg" alt="" width="112" height="112">
      </button>
      <button class="icon-button" aria-label="Cursor">
        <img src="/assets/icons/mouse_light.svg" alt="" width="112" height="112">
      </button>
    </div>
  </aside>

</div>

<section class="projects">
  <hr class="section-separator">
  <h2 class="section-title">Design work</h2>

  {% for project in collections.projects %}
  <article class="project-card">

    <div class="project-content">

      <div class="project-meta">
        <time datetime="{{ project.data.date }}">{{ project.data.date }}</time>
        <span class="company">{{ project.data.company }}</span>
      </div>

      <h3 class="project-title">
        {% if project.data.case_study %}
          <a href="{{ project.url }}">{{ project.data.title }}</a>
        {% else %}
          {{ project.data.title }}
        {% endif %}
      </h3>

      <p class="project-blurb">{{ project.data.blurb }}</p>

      <div class="project-gallery">
        <figure class="gallery-main">
          {% set firstImage = project.data.preview_images[0] if project.data.preview_images else project.data.images[0] %}
          <img src="{{ firstImage }}" alt="{{ project.data.title }} preview">
        </figure>
        <ul class="gallery-thumbs" role="list">
          {% set galleryImages = project.data.preview_images if project.data.preview_images else project.data.images %}
          {% for image in galleryImages %}
          <li>
            <button class="thumb-button" data-src="{{ image }}" aria-label="View image {{ loop.index }}">
              <img src="{{ image }}" alt="{{ project.data.title }} thumbnail {{ loop.index }}">
            </button>
          </li>
          {% endfor %}
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>

    <ul class="project-tags" role="list">
      <li>Categories</li>
      {% if project.data.tags %}
      {% for tag in project.data.tags %}
      <li><a class="tag" href="/tags/{{ tag | slugify }}/">{{ tag }}</a></li>
      {% endfor %}
      {% endif %}
    </ul>

  </article>
  {% endfor %}

</section>
